# PDF fixtures are hand-built with byte-exact xref offsets computed
# against LF-only line endings. Without this, Git's autocrlf handling
# (core.autocrlf=true is common on Windows) treats these ASCII-only
# PDFs as text and rewrites LF -> CRLF on checkout, corrupting the
# offsets and breaking pdfjs-dist parsing. Force binary handling.
*.pdf binary
